    "включите раздел «Работа в фоне» в настройках плагина.\n"
    "\n"
    "Scheduled Telegram gifts: pick a gift, a recipient and a time, and the plugin sends it "
    "for you. You do not have to stay online or keep Telegram open: turn on the \"Background work\" "
    "section in plugin settings."
)
